contentText:
Taylor Swift , HAIM and Mariska Hargitay showed off a little of their Knicks love when they attended the NBA Finals game four on Wednesday (June 10), sporting homemade Knicks-themed T-shirts, and now, their creator &#8212; Alana Haim herself &#8212; is revealing how the tees came about.

Related

